| Finding | Pass criteria |
|---------|---------------|
| F1 | User B identity on all APIs after User A logout + User B login |
| F4 | Restricted role → 403 on admin endpoints |
| F3 | Renamed wrong-type file → 400 before processing |
| F5 | Auth + authz on all endpoints; rate limits active |
| F6 | Prior session dead on new login (if policy requires) |
